<title>JAPAN: Japan July large store sales down 4.1% yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Japan July large store sales down 4.1% yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sales at Japanese department stores and supermarkets fell 4.1 percent in July from a year earlier to 2.16 trillion yen, the Ministry of International Trade and Industry said on Thursday.</p>
<p>				  JUL	 JUN	MAY</p>
<p>    Overall change	 -4.1	+2.1     -1.0</p>
<p>	Dept stores	  -2.9	+2.7     +0.8</p>
<p>	Supermarkets	 -5.3	+1.5     -2.8</p>
</text>
